<title>RUSSIA: British Gas Russia oil jv boosts 96 output.</title>
<headline>British Gas Russia oil jv boosts 96 output.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian oil firm KomArcticOil, a joint venture between British Gas Plc and Russian oil company KomiTEK, produced 1.13 million tonnes of oil in 1996, up 41 percent from 1995 levels, the venture said in a statement.</p>
<p>It said it was the first time over the venture's five year history that annual output exceeded one million tonnes.</p>
</text>
